      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside the community center, veteran comedian Franck Dubosc catches up with young actor Dylan. Feeling guilty about their violent confrontation on set, Franck proposes an unusual and direct way to clear the air. Let's listen to their conversation in French first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
